title: Intro
---
<<bg lab>>
<<bgm intro>>
<<show Tetra neutral left>>
Tetra: Pricilla. Wake up. The alarms just went quiet.
<<show Pricilla neutral right>>
<<sfx portal>>
Pricilla: Five more minutes...
<<show Tetra mad left>>
Tetra: Guards in the halls, cameras on every ceiling. We don't have five minutes.
-> Pricilla: Fine. My portals will get us past the locked doors.
    <<show Pricilla happy right>>
    Tetra: And if they look our way, I'll stop time.
-> Pricilla: Can't we just run for it?
    <<show Pricilla mad right>>
    Tetra: Not if you want to see daylight again.
<<show Tetra neutral left>>
Tetra: Stay out of their sight. Use the consoles to open the doors for each other.
<<hide_all>>
<<stop_bgm>>
<<wait 0.3>>
===
